{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "f8643ef0db2785ffcb54f2f5ad3f9b587c6342db7706560c87144f5b9f522599", "ja": "うう～っ、やっぱりガマンできないぞ～！\nたまき、ちょっと遊びに行ってくるっ！", "zh": "呜呜～，果然还是忍不住啦～！\n环去玩一下就回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "2d9d443e7716722dc255eaa20299bcb54e83243f0fb97b67d0057b638051e289", "ja": "こらこら、だーめ。環は今からアタシたちと、\n公演のミーティングでしょ？", "zh": "好啦好啦，不行。环接下来要和我们一起开公演会议，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "d58c66302fa5c57bc83d908d29ba87cce895b6bd1ed9049f8a2b2e0305b25ace", "ja": "あ、そうだった……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊，对哦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "c7fce6903950c461dbaa29ac2f2e04c89cba3033ba58e18b7a18edae971d83cd", "ja": "それに、雨が上がったばっかだし。もうちょっと\n土が乾いてからの方がいいんじゃない？", "zh": "而且雨才刚停。等泥土再干一点，不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "2d3a9d03db985c8219ea126e3f9365f067b008398a34b766a0bcb82701aae436", "ja": "ミーティングが終わるころには、\n遊びやすくなってると思うよ。", "zh": "我想等会议结束的时候，应该就更适合玩了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "49a349716fa55b2cd7b5999262771f8b750a43e7e93bc04c7a5524900bec84a7", "ja": "そうですね。今すぐ遊びに行ったら、\n泥だらけになっちゃいそうですもんね。", "zh": "是啊，要是现在马上去玩，肯定会弄得满身泥吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4307723dabb5872ca80df57112942804c24e743eee9b4de83721d89cebe5ad2b", "ja": "そっかぁ。のりこ、頭いいー！", "zh": "这样啊。纪子，你真聪明——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1007_se", "source_sha256": "859b95c58099c5bec5dab51691bbacae12c257957c4e5bf67b74f3403af0436b", "ja": "ドタドタドタ……バタンッ！", "zh": "哒哒哒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "5776376f014f97e8211d1438d7f09b5b08fbfc464378fd8aedd472eb9e472521", "ja": "だから、それじゃダメだって\n言ってるでしょう！", "zh": "所以，我不是说了那样不行吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43b502d54554f85786cd909ab960a72e53289245e8b6754b90c9b61a56f7c504", "ja": "そんなことないもん！\n静香ちゃんのケチ！", "zh": "才不是那样！\n静香真小气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "ad3bb4a6225403a3c7367d35f74e17fdc94a69d777f05b470f19a97c362a057c", "ja": "わっ！？　……しずかと、つばさ？", "zh": "哇！？……静香和翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "36e50adaf6e624dfdcb04af0596237aaeeead526b891fbc6163f83d8aa90454e", "ja": "び、びっくりしたぁ……。\n今の大きな声、静香ちゃんと翼だったの？", "zh": "吓、吓我一跳……  \n刚才那声大喊，是静香和翼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "47937b7f95454d8a218e6a5bb33bf450d310fa10cb76b5efa54d1e187148d86d", "ja": "どうしたの？　ふたりとも。\n声、だいぶ響いてるよ。", "zh": "怎么了？你们两个。\n声音都传得很远了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "3f504735cc3a598b4b512e4417510b6b3234e2c044c40877fd8eb3025031baac", "ja": "どうもこうもないです！\n翼があんまりワガママなことを言うから……！", "zh": "没什么好问的！\n都是因为翼她太任性了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6773a03b8446192c120f8e290c2200033bbca857ba51ac636f1a3ca08265672", "ja": "わたしだって、静香ちゃんがこんなに\nわからず屋だなんて思わなかったな～。", "zh": "我也没想到，静香居然会这么\n不可理喻呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "74a498277e04607c76da3e21ee951dd28ca080fee4341c92223dacd3ca9f695c", "ja": "私は、わからず屋なんかじゃありません！", "zh": "我才不是什么死脑筋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf1adc4d0dd9a6aa82ebce8df6b443c8d68d0b39f054b5be4de2b25258953bf6", "ja": "わたしだって、ワガママじゃないもん！", "zh": "我才不是任性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "82890ecbce85a8d581ccdeb94509e6e417a60f80f9a48d85bf7b0d0f50a56469", "ja": "えっと、えっと……。", "zh": "那个，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "6ca70e924a9e13616f1a14daf4c2bcf1fb0ff673872c28eeb79a7a5b11cee056", "ja": "ふたりとも、環ちゃんがビックリしてるから、\nその辺でやめた方が……。", "zh": "你们两个，环都被吓到了，还是先到此为止吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1022_se", "source_sha256": "1aeb687e96bf205aeb94a5e1d78e93b7db7e2c2275d7db9fa82b54ed81fc9d2d", "ja": "ピカッ", "zh": "闪亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "3194a7d21515cb978d4b9a6e342383f278f045e4947b5d0cf45453d7b95f1eae", "ja": "ん？　今、遠くで光ったのって……雷？", "zh": "嗯？刚才远处闪过的，是……雷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "46648443d0866210051c5eaa91acecf21e24997dd3964d6d831e595c496230ec", "ja": "あっ、お天気が……\nいつの間に、こんなに暗くなってたんでしょう？", "zh": "啊，天气……\n不知不觉间，已经变得这么阴暗了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "596c5d80b8025092c1a96047b8a12501c51e198eac19ff9eea55f0a7f16640f8", "ja": "うん。さっきまであんなに晴れてたのに、\n今にも降り出しそうだね。", "zh": "嗯，刚才还那么晴朗，现在看起来马上就要下雨了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1027_se", "source_sha256": "8c40cadb9a0f2626401ccfffe333a4dd4c36129766437c9023adeee8e94aeb22", "ja": "ドドーン！", "zh": "咻──砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1028_se", "source_sha256": "fc1c626197908466b0803652aa6839f6030a46c0d39c2b4500c4ce6f95520780", "ja": "ザアアアッ……", "zh": "哗啦啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "2cc0479505a003df8d773fe6eeb4a2e409b5b380889e4e52e65931724623c54e", "ja": "あっ、雨……！", "zh": "啊，下雨了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "a950efc0f3ebb30caaec4fd6e4151745cf820231531af4aef7a57a65af1a6409", "ja": "あちゃ～、降り出しちゃったか……。", "zh": "哎呀～下起来了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a37e7d8a7f3220bc2987076f362d1b72d1822cd981d96c14712d9e3df8cbf871", "ja": "前から思ってたけど、静香ちゃんって、\nすっごくガンコなところがあるよね！", "zh": "我之前就觉得，静香真是有特别固执的一面呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "dcfe1332082c16cbfe364d1557061a5e5d51cf784770e9b5dc3232075500217e", "ja": "違うわ、翼が自由過ぎるの！\nもっと協調性を持って行動しないと……。", "zh": "不对，是翼太随性了！做事必须更有协调性才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "4333de8ebe9dd0e4840470b6bda0d4e949481dc9e50f923c163a54f71961932a", "ja": "し、しずか、つばさ…………\nケンカしちゃ、ヤダぞ～！！", "zh": "静、静香，翼……\n不许吵架啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "5b3fdb8f0221625e2d1117b3b073fdcb65226426e2e75cdbb7289e6b3df1d80c", "ja": "わーーーん！", "zh": "呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "8112250bf27ea6ce0239a3146c8932c42ed2a189331dd59648797a686a1f067e", "ja": "環、泣かなくても大丈夫だよ～！", "zh": "环，不哭也没关系哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "8b79ac027934a62a14e7a942712fea7aff9a7ba2fdbad8471761a0f42ad76e11", "ja": "そうだよ、環ちゃん！", "zh": "是啊，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1039_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1040_p", "source_sha256": "8c510db49fc706b439a84a0e9c44fb32c9580bd961d9b97bea86092d31b77de5", "ja": "お疲れさま。大きな声が聞こえたけど……\n環？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了。刚才听到了很大的声音……环？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "6d126b6fe313673fb72ebe6d0b2a1bddacffb98496d0e0f1e21ec01d6e740122", "ja": "おやぶん……！", "zh": "老大……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "3f70b50ed284dcb64bca064db9316cc95a87e322e5fea3848f80127669b5a615", "ja": "いやー。静香と翼の口ゲンカが、\nヒートアップしちゃってさ……。", "zh": "哎呀——。静香和翼拌嘴，\n一下子情绪上头了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "dcfcf2c42704d269ecd2d17836535ed8bfe7e8b22473449983e6b5230314b155", "ja": "それで、環ちゃんが「ケンカしないで」って\n泣いちゃったんです。", "zh": "然后，环就哭着说“不要吵架”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "71e785c7d9e8e2446bd68ba4ec534c483ecab1edc42113179bc4f4dec08ab5e9", "ja": "うう……ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜呜……抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1045_p", "source_sha256": "4f419460ce9869cce0c88df3a02f6b39f0f7e2d9d86277fbad15c909b9fb2eae", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったのか。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1046_p", "source_sha256": "eef7ca14eb5abf1a251284e7d9b5be5b8ac6f2dabb35d837e2c8ff1a835b6036", "ja": "静香、翼。理由はともかく……\n皆が心配するから、ケンカは程々にしないとな。", "zh": "静香、翼，不管原因是什么……大家都会担心，所以你们别吵得太过分了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16a7a6c4e5429d75393111b136bb5550f5aa79a9e799f7d30dfbdfd0ecb5d001", "ja": "ごめんなさ～い……。", "zh": "对不起～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "774461c6ef71b21f91ee3ff23f7cccca20c6dca42ce25dbe7899d345485a5548", "ja": "は、反省してます……。\nごめんね、環……。", "zh": "我、我在反省了……  \n对不起，环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_098_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "4447e83af8b9ea66ca96dbcab1423447608acee8c31ab999cf0942f7bdcdbfc9", "ja": "ありゃ……だいぶショックだったみたいだね。\n{$P$}、ミーティングは……。", "zh": "哎呀……看来你受打击不小啊。\n{$P$}，会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
